{"fps": 30, "frames": 1422, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 108, "text": "The dullest stocks in America made one man a fortune.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 8, "e": 13}, {"w": "dullest", "f": 14, "e": 27}, {"w": "stocks", "f": 27, "e": 38}, {"w": "in", "f": 39, "e": 43}, {"w": "America", "f": 44, "e": 56}, {"w": "made", "f": 57, "e": 65}, {"w": "one", "f": 65, "e": 71}, {"w": "man", "f": 72, "e": 78}, {"w": "a", "f": 78, "e": 81}, {"w": "fortune.", "f": 82, "e": 96}]}, {"a": 108, "b": 277, "text": "Nineteen forty-seven. You're Shelby Davis, thirty-eight, a former insurance regulator.", "words": [{"w": "Nineteen", "f": 110, "e": 126}, {"w": "forty-seven.", "f": 126, "e": 150}, {"w": "You're", "f": 150, "e": 163}, {"w": "Shelby", "f": 163, "e": 176}, {"w": "Davis,", "f": 176, "e": 189}, {"w": "thirty-eight,", "f": 189, "e": 215}, {"w": "a", "f": 215, "e": 218}, {"w": "former", "f": 219, "e": 231}, {"w": "insurance", "f": 232, "e": 250}, {"w": "regulator.", "f": 250, "e": 270}]}, {"a": 277, "b": 394, "text": "You take your wife's fifty thousand dollars and buy insurance stocks.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 279, "e": 285}, {"w": "take", "f": 286, "e": 293}, {"w": "your", "f": 293, "e": 301}, {"w": "wife's", "f": 301, "e": 311}, {"w": "fifty", "f": 312, "e": 321}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 321, "e": 334}, {"w": "dollars", "f": 335, "e": 347}, {"w": "and", "f": 347, "e": 353}, {"w": "buy", "f": 354, "e": 359}, {"w": "insurance", "f": 360, "e": 375}, {"w": "stocks.", "f": 375, "e": 387}]}, {"a": 394, "b": 477, "text": "Insurance. The most unloved corner of the market.", "words": [{"w": "Insurance.", "f": 396, "e": 412}, {"w": "The", "f": 413, "e": 418}, {"w": "most", "f": 418, "e": 425}, {"w": "unloved", "f": 426, "e": 437}, {"w": "corner", "f": 438, "e": 447}, {"w": "of", "f": 448, "e": 452}, {"w": "the", "f": 452, "e": 458}, {"w": "market.", "f": 458, "e": 469}]}, {"a": 477, "b": 573, "text": "By nineteen fifty, they sell for four times earnings.", "words": [{"w": "By", "f": 479, "e": 483}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 484, "e": 498}, {"w": "fifty,", "f": 498, "e": 509}, {"w": "they", "f": 510, "e": 517}, {"w": "sell", "f": 518, "e": 525}, {"w": "for", "f": 526, "e": 532}, {"w": "four", "f": 532, "e": 540}, {"w": "times", "f": 540, "e": 550}, {"w": "earnings.", "f": 550, "e": 566}]}, {"a": 573, "b": 633, "text": "So how does boring make you rich?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 575, "e": 579}, {"w": "how", "f": 580, "e": 585}, {"w": "does", "f": 586, "e": 592}, {"w": "boring", "f": 593, "e": 603}, {"w": "make", "f": 603, "e": 610}, {"w": "you", "f": 611, "e": 616}, {"w": "rich?", "f": 617, "e": 625}]}, {"a": 633, "b": 749, "text": "You see, it's an apple orchard. First, the trees grow more apples.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 635, "e": 640}, {"w": "see,", "f": 641, "e": 648}, {"w": "it's", "f": 649, "e": 656}, {"w": "an", "f": 657, "e": 661}, {"w": "apple", "f": 662, "e": 671}, {"w": "orchard.", "f": 671, "e": 685}, {"w": "First,", "f": 686, "e": 697}, {"w": "the", "f": 697, "e": 703}, {"w": "trees", "f": 704, "e": 713}, {"w": "grow", "f": 713, "e": 721}, {"w": "more", "f": 721, "e": 729}, {"w": "apples.", "f": 729, "e": 741}]}, {"a": 749, "b": 857, "text": "Then apples come into fashion, and every apple sells for more.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 751, "e": 758}, {"w": "apples", "f": 759, "e": 769}, {"w": "come", "f": 770, "e": 777}, {"w": "into", "f": 778, "e": 785}, {"w": "fashion,", "f": 786, "e": 799}, {"w": "and", "f": 800, "e": 806}, {"w": "every", "f": 806, "e": 815}, {"w": "apple", "f": 816, "e": 825}, {"w": "sells", "f": 825, "e": 834}, {"w": "for", "f": 835, "e": 840}, {"w": "more.", "f": 841, "e": 850}]}, {"a": 857, "b": 915, "text": "Davis called it the double play.", "words": [{"w": "Davis", "f": 859, "e": 867}, {"w": "called", "f": 868, "e": 878}, {"w": "it", "f": 878, "e": 882}, {"w": "the", "f": 883, "e": 888}, {"w": "double", "f": 889, "e": 898}, {"w": "play.", "f": 899, "e": 907}]}, {"a": 915, "b": 1041, "text": "Ten years later, insurers sold for fifteen to twenty times earnings.", "words": [{"w": "Ten", "f": 917, "e": 923}, {"w": "years", "f": 923, "e": 933}, {"w": "later,", "f": 934, "e": 945}, {"w": "insurers", "f": 945, "e": 960}, {"w": "sold", "f": 961, "e": 969}, {"w": "for", "f": 969, "e": 975}, {"w": "fifteen", "f": 976, "e": 989}, {"w": "to", "f": 990, "e": 994}, {"w": "twenty", "f": 995, "e": 1006}, {"w": "times", "f": 1007, "e": 1016}, {"w": "earnings.", "f": 1017, "e": 1033}]}, {"a": 1041, "b": 1135, "text": "Rich? He still scribbled notes on old envelopes.", "words": [{"w": "Rich?", "f": 1043, "e": 1052}, {"w": "He", "f": 1052, "e": 1057}, {"w": "still", "f": 1057, "e": 1066}, {"w": "scribbled", "f": 1067, "e": 1082}, {"w": "notes", "f": 1083, "e": 1092}, {"w": "on", "f": 1093, "e": 1097}, {"w": "old", "f": 1098, "e": 1103}, {"w": "envelopes.", "f": 1104, "e": 1121}]}, {"a": 1135, "b": 1274, "text": "By nineteen ninety-four, fifty thousand had become nine hundred million.", "words": [{"w": "By", "f": 1137, "e": 1141}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 1142, "e": 1156}, {"w": "ninety-four,", "f": 1157, "e": 1178}, {"w": "fifty", "f": 1178, "e": 1188}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 1188, "e": 1203}, {"w": "had", "f": 1203, "e": 1209}, {"w": "become", "f": 1210, "e": 1221}, {"w": "nine", "f": 1222, "e": 1229}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 1230, "e": 1243}, {"w": "million.", "f": 1243, "e": 1258}]}, {"a": 1274, "b": 1422, "text": "He didn't buy exciting stocks. He bought them before they were exciting.", "words": [{"w": "He", "f": 1276, "e": 1280}, {"w": "didn't", "f": 1281, "e": 1291}, {"w": "buy", "f": 1292, "e": 1298}, {"w": "exciting", "f": 1298, "e": 1312}, {"w": "stocks.", "f": 1313, "e": 1325}, {"w": "He", "f": 1325, "e": 1329}, {"w": "bought", "f": 1330, "e": 1341}, {"w": "them", "f": 1341, "e": 1348}, {"w": "before", "f": 1349, "e": 1360}, {"w": "they", "f": 1360, "e": 1367}, {"w": "were", "f": 1368, "e": 1375}, {"w": "exciting.", "f": 1376, "e": 1391}]}]}